# krome_init_abund.dat -- modern Earth, CH4 + layered H2O (DRAFT 2026-11-18, updated 2026-11-20)
#
# Same as krome_init_abund_earth_modern_CH4only.dat plus a stepped H2O profile:
# moist up to the model's tropopause (T minimum, layer 59, ~350 hPa), dry above.
# Third column = first layer of the entry, counted from the top (empty or 1 =
# whole column). An entry holds down to the next entry's first layer (70-layer model).
#
CH4       1.9000E-06   # ~1900 ppb, biogenic source
#
H2O       4.0000E-06        # dry stratosphere, layers 1-58 (~4 ppmv)
H2O       1.3000E-03   59   # layers 59-65: upper troposphere (70% of saturation, 1.1-1.4e-3)
H2O       4.0000E-03   66   # layers 66-70: lower troposphere (70% of saturation, 2.0-6.4e-3)
